[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Disconnect electrical connection (1a), then undo and remove engine\noil pressure warning light (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Brake fluid level sensor (switch)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890615\">K30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034011.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Screw in the engine oil pressure warning\nlight.</p><p>Tighten the engine oil pressure warning\nlight to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>OIL PRESSURE W/L</p></td><td><p>M14 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the lift.</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]